# arcgis-shareable-card

This component can be wrapped around other components to make them shareable. It can be used on an ad-hoc basis or in another component's render method like:

```
render () {
  return <Host>
    <arcgis-shareable-card ...props>
      ...component internals
    </arcgis-shareable-card>
  </Host>
}
```

Note that there is a `Shareable` function component that makes usage somewhat easier:

```
import { Shareable } from "../functional/shareable";

render () {
  return (
    <Host>
      <Shareable context={this} showShareUi={this.optionalBoolean}>
        ...component internals
      </Shareable>
    </Host>
  );
}
```

